data ingested_classical_not_staging_composed_facts_scaffold: String = "Marked scaffold (lane: witness-realization / emit-host wet legs; owner: v2-inferred-tree-completeness; trigger: carrier split makes incomplete InferredTree unwritable so staging cannot compose over infer judgments). ingested_staging_inferred_tree_from_source is facts-flow-forward: Holds preserves canonical infer facts verbatim, including GroundingNotDerived — never upgrades infer's judgment to hand-composed DerivedGrounding. Violates (lookup miss) alone receives ingested_classical_not_composed_facts as the offline wet-leg frontier until the trigger fires. ingested_wet_emit_eval_composed_tree_from_source is the separate wet-only carrier: composed DerivedGrounding on every lookup so emit accepts and eval admits facts — never enrolled per-PR and never masquerades as canonical infer output."

data ingested_classical_not_emit_mock_shape_note: String = "KERNEL-D TESTING RE-STEER (operator direction, 2026-07-24): per-PR layer-boundary mock proof for the classical_not cutover's emit-to-text half — ingested_emit_shape_frontier_tree_from_source (orch-emit-compatible empty facts map) -> assert emitted Rust TEXT (string compare, no compile). ingested_canonical_inferred_tree_from_source is the pure infer carrier; ingested_classical_not_canonical_emit_refuses_underived_holds and ingested_classical_not_staging_emit_refuses_underived_holds witness translate refuses recorded GroundingNotDerived. Wet/nightly emit-vs-eval legs use ingested_wet_emit_eval_composed_tree_from_source (composed facts on every lookup — emit accepts, eval admits); shape-frontier stays emit-only. Deliberately excludes wet legs from per-PR CommitCheckEnrollment."

